docs/api/mcp.md

# Agent prompts — these get sent verbatim to LLMs (the static head
# is the cache-eligible prefix per ADR 0010, the dynamic tail is the
# per-call substitution surface). Prettier's prose reflow strips the
# leading whitespace on bullet-list continuation lines, which both
# breaks the markdown rendering and changes the bytes the LLM
# receives. The prompts are semantically meaningful — exclude them.
agents/**/*.md
